# Runtime-first robotics research routing contract

The normal route reads corpus/robotics-research-runtime.v1.json only.
The complete 100-paper corpus and paper-level signatures are local-only
offline inputs for validation and runtime-artifact rebuilding.

The shared runtime supplies eight research axes, compact exemplars, axis
strategy rows, 15 parent patterns, 31 subpatterns, evidence boundaries, and
venue-scope candidates. It does not claim PCA, latent-factor estimation,
real UMAP/HDBSCAN, or acceptance probabilities.

Offline:

~~~text
python scripts/validate_public_paper_index.py <local-corpus>
python scripts/build_robotics_research_runtime.py --input <local-corpus>
~~~

Online:

~~~text
python scripts/route_robotics_research.py <profile.json> --stage idea|experiment|writing|review
~~~
